<title>USA: Chubb names John Degnan president.</title>
<headline>Chubb names John Degnan president.</headline>
<dateline>WARREN, N.J. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chubb Corp said on Thursday it named John Degnan president of the company.</p>
<p>Degnan is replacing Dean O'Hare who will continue as the chairman and chief executive, Chubb said.</p>
<p>Degnan will remain managing director, vice chairman and general counsel of Chubb &amp; Son Inc, the company's property and casualty underwriting manager.</p>
